# <type>(<scope>): <lowercase imperative subject (max 72 chars, NO EMOJIS)>
# └ imperative, lowercase, no trailing period, header <= 72 chars, zero emojis
#
#
# Explain *why* this change was needed. The diff already shows what changed.
# Wrap lines at 72 columns.
#
# Refs #<issue-number>
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Types:
#   feat      a new capability (minor version bump)
#   fix       a defect repair (patch version bump)
#   docs      documentation only
#   refactor  restructuring, no behavior change
#   perf      performance improvement
#   test      adding or correcting tests
#   build     build system, dependencies, packaging
#   ci        pipelines and workflows
#   chore     maintenance that fits nothing else
#   revert    reverting a previous commit
#
# Breaking change: feat(scope)!: ... or BREAKING CHANGE: footer
#
# Footers:
#   Refs #<issue-number>  (REQUIRED: issue reference)
#   Fixes #<issue-number> (closes issue on merge)
#   Closes #<issue-number>
#
# Strict Rules:
# - English only. No emojis anywhere.
# - No tool attribution trailers, session URLs, or generation notes.
# - Enable with: git config commit.template .gitmessage
# - Full rules: AGENTS.md
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
